Package: metascience
Title: Catalogue and Shared Infrastructure for Open Metascience Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pablo", "Sánchez-Núñez", email = "psancheznunez@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7845-9506"))
Description: Catalogue and shared conventions for a set of independent,
    interoperable tools that study research: research indicators, narrative
    CVs, academic careers, artificial intelligence use in research, science
    communication and the integrity and reproducibility of research outputs.
    Lists the tools with their domain, maturity and release status; reports
    which of them are installed; validates and normalises persistent
    identifiers (DOI, 'ORCID' iD, 'ROR' ID) with their check digits;
    harmonises the result statuses the tools use, so that an unverifiable
    result is never read as a negative one; writes a machine-readable
    provenance manifest for any analysis; and offers a 'Shiny' interface
    with a section for each installed tool. Every tool remains usable on
    its own.
